- Manuscript material under `paper/latex/` and manuscript figures under `paper/figures/` are not covered by the MIT or CC BY 4.0 grants above. All rights are reserved pending the applicable publication agreement.
- `paper/latex/elsarticle.cls` is copyright Elsevier Ltd and is distributed under the LaTeX Project Public License stated in that file.
- Any third-party material retains its original ownership and license.

If a file could fall under more than one category, the more specific directory rule above controls.

